OL,3,AA village familiar with tragedy mourns
OL,4,ANoah Woods
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen three-year-old Noah Woods
OL,7,Fdisappeared, hundreds came together in
OL,8,Fthe hope of bringing him home.
OL,10,FIt was at about 15:00 BST on Tuesday
OL,11,Fwhen he became separated from a
OL,12,Frelative while at a playground in
OL,13,FBrantham, Suffolk.
OL,15,FThe following day the news came that
OL,16,Fnobody wanted to hear: a child's body
OL,17,Fhad been recovered from a nearby pond.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
