OL,3,AA village familiar with tragedy mourns
OL,4,ANoah Woods
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 1,300 people helped to try to
OL,7,Ffind him, coming together in hope then
OL,8,Fgrief. It is not the first time this
OL,9,Fvillage of about 2,600 people has been
OL,10,Fhit by tragedy. Just how does a
OL,11,Fcommunity come to terms with such a
OL,12,Floss?
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
